Z||000000||Haze_Performance||06-20-2000||02:23 AM||||I cant load the pic's on the forum. I NEED HELP!! I downloaded Pennock's Image Poster. Now what do I do?? Now please don’t leave out any detail. For some reason I just cant grasp how this works. I need someone to go over this with me  s..l..o..w..l..y . <P>God I feel stupid  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||06-20-2000||02:35 AM||||Haze, When the program comes up click on NEW at bottom. The next window will have AUTOMATIC on it. Type in <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</A>  and click on the GET button. This should load the PFF profile. Then click on BROWSE select your pic then click POST IT. When it says it done switch to the message you are typing and do a CNTRL V and your done!<P>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-20-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-20-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||tgowens||06-20-2000||02:38 AM||||Haze!! get a grip man!! don't panic!!.........<P>1. begin your message (or reply)<BR>2. open PIP (Pennock's Image Poster) by clicking on the icon (should be on your desktop or in the programs section off of the start button)<BR>3. when PIP opens click the 'browse' button and find the image you want to post<BR>4. when you find the right image, click on it<BR>5. click 'post it' on the PIP<BR>6. return to the message you were writing or your reply and hold down the 'Ctrl' key and the 'V' key at the same time.........<BR>7. click 'submit reply'<BR>8. close the PIP application.........<P>there ya go - step by step -- if you have any problem with it, email me --  <A HREF="mailto:terry@tgowens.com">terry@tgowens.com</A>  and I will try to help again.........hope this helps..||||reg||1
Z||000003||Haze_Performance||06-20-2000||03:31 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Haze, When the program comes up click on NEW at bottom. The next window will have AUTOMATIC on it. Type in <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</A>  and click on the GET button. This should load the PFF profile. Then click on BROWSE select your pic then click POST IT. When it says it done switch to the message you are typing and do a CNTRL V and your done!<P>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-20-2000).]<P>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-20-2000).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>When i type in <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</A>  in the space it says "Invalid URL" ????now what??<P>||||reg||5
Z||000005||Oreif||06-20-2000||10:05 AM||||Haze, Open the pip program click on new, Then click on the bottom of this page. The blue box, see where it says "auto config" on the left side. Click that and the URL will appear.<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-20-2000).]||||reg||1
